<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets New World Infra warrants.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets New World Infra warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Monday it issued 400 million American-style call warrants on shares of New World Infrastructure Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   HK$20.61	  PREMIUM	13.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE    HK$0.545	  GEARING	4.20X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION     03.MAR.98	 BOARD LOT    2,000</p>
<p> LISTING	  HONG KONG	 PAY DATE     17.MAR.97</p>
<p> SPOT PRICE     HK$22.90	  LISTING DATE 19.MAR.97</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT     CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
